      "message": "Line 648-676 are searching the scaled frames we swapped in at line 618, so they don\u0027t need the `block_ref_scale_factors`.\n\nLine 689 swaps the original frames back, which subpel search (line 702-736) works on, so they need the corresponding `block_ref_scale_factors`.",
